images, sounds and the Aplomb Estoc typeface may be viewed here and on the site, but not copied,
modified, distributed or used in other works without written permission
(contact@adamrodwebdev.com).

The Aplomb Estoc typeface and the 3D models are not in this repository: the site's deploy copies
them in from a private source. Aplomb Estoc is a typeface by Ressac, licensed to this site only and
covered by no licence of this repository; see fonts/AplombEstoc-LICENSE.md.

Third-party components keep their own licences:
- three.js, in vendor/three: MIT licence, see vendor/three/LICENSE.
- Archivo, in fonts/archivo, and Geist Mono, in fonts/geist-mono: SIL Open Font License 1.1, see
  the OFL.txt file in each folder.
- The road's sky in environment-road.png is derived from "Lenong 2" by Poly Haven, released under
  CC0.
